7a3JQUfBt6KCvK	2023-12-18 17:18:14.174625+00	2026-04-11 00:00:00.100998+00	\N	Infinite Zoop	Upgrade your Zoop!	Adds a research tree in the MAM where you can improve your Zoop capacity. Also enables multi-row & column Wall and Foundation construction.\n\n\n<img src="https://i.imgur.com/Q4ugBC9.jpeg" width="800">\n<br>\n<img src="https://i.imgur.com/uqJ02mY.jpeg" width="800">\n<br>\n<img src="https://i.imgur.com/dPB6xdu.jpeg" width="800">\n<br>\n\n\nIf you don't want to mess with research, you can activate "Cheater Mode" in the Mod Config found in the 'Mods' portion of the main game menu. This will give you unlimited Zoop immediately.\n\nYou can prevent the additional Zooping amounts from applying to Ladders in the Mod Config. \n\nYou can also set a threshold for how many items can be Zooped before the build effects are no longer shown, great for building hundreds or thousands of Foundations without lagging or crashing.\nThis setting is off by default but can be enabled and adjusted in the Mod Config within the game.\n\nYou can set a "Temporary Zoop Amount" using the chat command `/TempZoop [Amount]`. `/tz` and `/tzoop` also work. When a Temporary Zoop amount has been set your max zoop will be set to that amount. No more hunting for the perfect pixel to place just the right amount of foundations over and over.\nYou can disable the Temporary Zoop amount by setting the amount to `0` or `off`.\n\nYou can now scroll to zoop! While zooping, you can switch to "Precision Mode" by scrolling your mouse wheel. This prevents the zoop from changing based on where you aim but lets you change the amount of zoop with your scroll wheel. Works for everything that zoops except pillars. To exit mouse-scroll mode, reduce the number of holograms to 1 or right-click once.\n\n<br><br>**Please report any issues <a href="https://discord.gg/WM5KT7pVu8">on my Discord server</a>**<br><br>\n<a href="https://ko-fi.com/sirdigbymodding">SirDigby's completely optional tip jar</a><br><br>\n<br>\n**Mod Icon by Deantendo#4265**\n\n<a href="https://www.paypal.com/donate?hosted_button_id=H5NRHB2NFWUPQ">Care to tip Deantendo?</a>\n\n<br><br>\nChange Log:\n\n1.4.0:\n* Scroll to zoop!\n\n1.3.2:\n* MP Compatibility.... mostly! The Temporary Zoop command doesn't work for MP clients, yet.\n\n1.3.0:\n* Enabled Multi-Row & Column Wall construction \n\n1.2.0:\n* Added Temporary Zoop feature as a chat command\n\n1.1.1:\n* Renamed Corners config option and enabled it by default\n\n1.1.0:\n* Removed Zooping of Foundation and Walkway corners by default (They aren't zoopable in vanilla)\n* Added config option to enable Zooping of Foundation and Walkway corners\n\n1.0.3:\n* Fixed Level 5 research cost (Motors instead of Turbo Motors)\n\n1.0.2:\n* Ficsmas fix\n\n1.0.1:\n* Added support for Pillars and Ladders			6h8uF1DZHRYNoE	t	370	5	6	109	f	2024-10-07 16:28:06.281605+00	InfiniteZoop	f	{"EA": {"Note": "", "State": "Works"}, "EXP": {"Note": "", "State": "Works"}}	f	f	\N
