6FFJ6RemLmiyx7	2024-10-07 23:44:04.907712+00	2026-04-11 00:00:00.137093+00	\N	Stack Resizer	A mod that allows you to customize the volume of each stack type	## **Stack Resizer**\n\n![Multiplayer compatible](https://i.imgur.com/lOTzkg2.png)\n![EA and XP compatible](https://i.imgur.com/Vc4fgum.png)\n\nStack Resizer is a mod that allows you to customize the volume of each stack type, which are defined internally as Small (50), Medium (100), Big (200) and Huge (500).\n\nSince v1.2.0, stacks can be configured up to 9,999 without breaking UI layout.\n\n<br />\n\n---\n\n<br />\n\n<div style="text-align: center;">\n\n![Mod Configs](https://i.imgur.com/51BtYzx.png)\n\n![Inventory](https://i.imgur.com/GyzfoCu.png)\n\n</div>\n\n<br />\n\n---\n\n<br />\n\n<br />\n\n### Feedback\n\nIf you find bugs or have ideas to improve the mod, your feedback will be greatly appreciated. Feel free to ping me (**acxd25**) on [Satisfactory Modding](https://discord.gg/xkVJ73E) server.\n\n<br />\n\n### Changelog\n\n<details>\n  <summary>Click to view</summary>\n\n**1.2.1**\n * Fixed SR's functions execution phase. Executing too late during save loading appears to negatively affect users who set a new mod config after updating to v1.2.0; thanks to Rhino9481 and NahfiScared report\n\n**1.2.0**\n * Complete mod rewrite; moved almost all functions to a Subsystem\n * Improved MP support\n   * Clients will read/use host's mod config, this way clients can leave their personal config file intact for solo play\n * Increased stack limit to 9,999\n   * Thanks to [Robb](https://ficsit.app/user/6axpMZJjUTUBWU), stacks >=1000 a smaller font size will be used to avoid breaking UI layout\n   * Added a mod config option to force the use of a smaller font size even if you don't set stacks >=1000\n * Added new dependency on Map Function Library\n * Bump dependency on SML v3.6.1\n\n**1.1.4**\n * Update 8.2/8.3 support\n\n**1.1.3**\n * Removed dead/unused code\n * Added more checks to reduce unnecessary calls between save reloads\n * Use C++ functions to filter items, which is much more efficient. A big thank you to [Robb](https://ficsit.app/user/6axpMZJjUTUBWU) for allowing me to reuse the sorting functions from his [Inventory Filters](https://ficsit.app/mod/InventoryFilters) mod\n\n**1.1.1**\n * Removed unnecessary calls when reloading saves\n\n**1.1.0**\n * Complete rewrite! Now you can set the same volume size for different classes\n * Fixed an old bug that required a restart if the mod's config was changed a second time\n\n**1.0.3**\n * Update 8 support\n\n**1.0.2**\n * Code improvements and make the logs more verbose\n * Bump required SML version\n\n**1.0.1**\n * Code cleanup and leaving beta phase\n * Updated in-game icon\n\n**1.0.0**\n * Initial release\n\n</details>\n\n<br />\n\n---\n\n<br />\n\n## Thanks\n\n * Coffee Stain Studios\n * Mircea and co., which made this mod possible\n * [Robb](https://ficsit.app/user/6axpMZJjUTUBWU) for general guidance and allowing me to reuse the sorting functions from his [Inventory Filters](https://ficsit.app/mod/InventoryFilters) mod\n * [Smashicons](https://www.flaticon.com/authors/smashicons) for the logo and in-game icon\n 	https://storage-staging.ficsit.app/file/smr-staging-s3/images/mods/6FFJ6RemLmiyx7/logo.webp		7Jti559vydtc7v	t	156	2	7	4	f	2024-10-08 00:03:53.557713+00	StackResizer	f	{"EA": {"Note": "", "State": "Works"}, "EXP": {"Note": "", "State": "Works"}}	f	f	MAgKFwb5hYh3eIiNhch4eHh3+eKlPF8N
