2fHYVfB2aDoEQ4	2021-02-04 10:17:37.809977+00	2026-04-11 00:00:00.122655+00	\N	More Milestones +100	Challenge yourself with 200+ New Milestones, 300+ New Parts, 50+ New Buildings, over 1000 hours contents and  + !!! 	**Join the war effort in a coordinated mobilization of industrial resources to support a space military force.**\n\nThe purpose of the mod is to **motivate** yourself to make a **Mega Factory** and produce all the items as much as possible per minute.\n\nAdds **100+ Milestones** that gives you some **decoration, parts, alternative recipes and buildings as  rewards** and more **Inventory Space**.\n\nBetter use your **current save**, instead of begining a new game.\n\nMeet the TEAM:\n\n- M.Frost - Items creation and balancing\\ Storyline Writer\\ Crazy Scientist\n- Rahxus - New Meshes and icons\n- DukeLetholdu - New Meshes and icons\n- Hailun - New Meshes and icons\n- Andre Aquila - Programing/Meshs/icons \\ One man Army\n\n.\n\n\n**ATTENTION:** If you are having problems with this mod (single or multiplayer), use this program on the **Cheats Menu > Deduplicate Schematics**:\nhttps://github.com/Goz3rr/SatisfactorySaveEditor/releases/tag/v0.9.10\n\n.\n\n.\n\n\nTo use the benfits of this mod, you have to **scroll on tier 0 on the HUB**. You will see only **one Milestone**, and when you unlock it, the others will be **slowly available**.\n\n[![Suggestion](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-bfv7Dl_4Z98/X2h0PlbV_xI/AAAAAAAAoRo/mqcRg5bW6yUYsSSEzAX3dCS1YX0Zi5LBwCLcBGAsYHQ/s0/1-Sug.png)](https://forms.gle/8pTa6ijtBVV1pURJ9) [![Email](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Z1XQDytzUdI/X2h0PkmL7tI/AAAAAAAAoRk/QMXNV5HFhPwDZ9HgoENSdJz_RkF1YEIrgCLcBGAsYHQ/s0/2-mail.png)](mailto:moremilestone100@gmail.com) [![Discord](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-mOLrMizkkzw/X2h0PqWtWFI/AAAAAAAAoRs/Y3uqPPrPKgISYgfZFJKkl3Ir4Cy3VqKJgCLcBGAsYHQ/s0/3-Discord.png)](https://discord.gg/WQBz8HG) [![Wiki](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/--CpO2EjufmU/X2h0QVxkAUI/AAAAAAAAoRw/1Eqdkc5dd0Q9ILKlMsSoTsS5EjQDhVgcQCLcBGAsYHQ/s0/4-Wiki.png)](https://satisfactory-more-milestones-100-mod.fandom.com/) [![Donate](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-UMzzKT4ZDJo/X2h0QRHCHiI/AAAAAAAAoR0/TXBBJ6FfewsR-EFsalvdL92Mse5BkQNoACLcBGAsYHQ/s0/5-Donate.png)](https://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr?cmd=_donations&business=Moremilestone100%40gmail.com&item_name=More+Milestones+%2B100+&currency_code=USD&source=url) [![Donate](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-DgHCfp8FiL8/X4rVoxvCEdI/AAAAAAAAosg/s4daMT7VWVkcG7ShP8eJvDhuq4ADLCxhwCLcBGAsYHQ/s0/patre.png)](https://www.patreon.com/MoreMilestoneSatisfactory?fan_landing=true)\n\n\n\n-\n**Totals in this version:**\n\nTotals in this version\n- 335 Milestones\n- 573 Automated Recipes\n- 474 Parts\n- 103 Prizes \n- 15 Landmarks\n- 34 Themed Items (Halloween/Xmas)\n- 231 Usable Rewards\n- 126 Nodes (11 New Minable Node Type - 2 Fluids / 9 Solids)\n- 15 Trees  of New Consumable (Ogolberry/Rockberry)\n- 14 Engineer Logs\n- 6 Special Drop Pods\n- 1 Space Station\n\n\n\n**Including:**\n- New nodes: Villiaumite, Cobaltirite, Mud Water and Contaminated Oil\n- Alloy Foundry\n-Atmospheric Harvester\n-Big Industrial Storage Container\n-Big Industrial Storage Tank\n-Tall Stackable lookout tower\n-Domes\n- Toxic Extractor\n- Impurity Remover\n- Advanced Deep Drilling \n-The heating and filtering mysterious furnace\n-Toxin Reactor\n-Mk Rock Miner \n\nand more...\n\nThis mod is big and adds several new things/buildings to the game, and includes a dependency on these others mods to a better experience.\n\n**Dependecies:**\n- **+100 Milestone  [Complement 2](https://ficsit.app/mod/7vvc2RLV3ACXDL) ** (Graphic / 3D Meshs Files)\n- **+100 Milestone  [Complement 3](https://ficsit.app/mod/73nhQvYqJ88GeV) ** (Graphic / 3D Meshs Files)\n- **+100 Milestone  [Complement 4](https://ficsit.app/mod/7TyttsEEZZ6pdu) ** (Graphic / 3D Meshs Files)\n- **+100 Milestone  [Complement 5](https://ficsit.app/mod/3a8sfWB2JAjuAY) ** (Graphic / 3D Meshs Files)\n**Optional Dependecies:**\n- **+100 Milestone  [Kraigsta Infinity Milestones](https://ficsit.app/mod/9biouerzB6Febt) ** (More Milestones)\n\n**Better with:**\n- **Decoration Mod** (ability to Build Nature Decorations)\n- **Upside Down Foundations** (New kind of Foundations)\n- **3D Text** (You can put letter boxes in you Factory - Plus Ficsit Logos)\n- **PaintGunMK2** (Faster Paint Gun)\n- **Wall Hole Conveyor and Floor Hole** (More options on logistics)\n- **Covered Conveyor** (Decorative Conveyor Belts)\n- **Double Cargo Wagon** (Train MK2)\n- **Fluid Sink and BigStorageTank** (More Fluid Logistics)\n\nSuggest more/less on https://discord.gg/WQBz8HG\n\n\nCollaboration of **AndreAquila** with **M.Frost#6954**!\n-\nThanks for testing, suggesting and motivate us: Kraigsta, Jackietimsy, Jsennin, ShadowWalker, Vitality, Rob, viinamäen mies, bluerat, SharkieJr, Mrhid6, I'm_a_chicken29 and a lot of other players of this amazing game!\n\n\nTrain Tunnel Mesh made by **Tom**\n\n-\n\n![](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-LWDIyQoSbn8/X1361J6yKOI/AAAAAAAAoOs/J6ZQw53cO5c4jRre6M_n7QrwY4ydvONBwCLcBGAsYHQ/w481-h180/com_mp_yes.png)\n\nSome players reported an error in multiplayer on this mod. But some manage to solve it: Uninstalled the mods, created a new save without the mods. Then loaded up the new save with the mods and it magically worked.\n\n![More Milestones](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-9K2HIz3XR88/X0J5948BO3I/AAAAAAAAn_g/YwaxtwTDeCYTjuDfYwRDcWEL4lmx9RQiQCLcBGAsYHQ/s640/Screenshot20200820-19352000000.png)\n\nTo discover how you do the new recipes, Press N in game and digit the name:\n\n![More Milestones](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/--FRI2m1WB14/X1TIIJIZviI/AAAAAAAAoNg/dpx5GmpKTuYhIymx2tJWIEHQgIcuExuHQCLcBGAsYHQ/w625-h298/11.png)\n\nXmas Theme:\n\n![More Milestones](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-sP3EJZW7ssY/X6kZJ5OFW-I/AAAAAAAAo2U/JPn0xtJVIOIX8NXeMZuDBXOZ9rRF6BA_wCLcBGAsYHQ/w509-h286/Screenshot20201108-11095100000.png)\n\nHalloween Theme:\n\n![More Milestones](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-X3oTkF5auVU/X39QAfYy-RI/AAAAAAAAonA/X25LS-s7y-oMCHwITYBNbfpwAwrv3JnnACLcBGAsYHQ/w545-h307/Screenshot20201008-14440100000.png)\n\n![MoreMilestones](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-p-BjBClbFu4/X1eDaf0-a5I/AAAAAAAAoN4/ffaudfOcuVc4ZfvctpThPfiFXfcKkqNMwCLcBGAsYHQ/w625-h351/Screenshot20200908-10123800000.png)\n\n![MoreMilestones](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-3YgLVcdHXcI/X3JNDosa5YI/AAAAAAAAoUk/f_vRHG37HCotKC24m1Ei39o60AZqvv1HwCPcBGAYYCw/s600/20200928152854_1.jpg)\n\n![MoreMilestones](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-RyTk4q1yvYo/X1JNl_dW8fI/AAAAAAAAoMA/y-pM31MR5e4pVVsWM7IvTMdXtDNYvk-RwCLcBGAsYHQ/w625-h351/Screenshot20200904-11214200000.png)\n\n![MoreMilestones](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-9BQ5y9JHZZA/X0kS8wS_JQI/AAAAAAAAoIA/OPgzQpm87FUTFWQ9fFq2iWm1g2z3uVPmgCLcBGAsYHQ/s640/HighResScreenshot20200827-092851.png)\n\n![MoreMilestones](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-LVc3lEZWDrE/X32gIXwqk4I/AAAAAAAAomU/HGqBzlesGD4Zdl2-R7lBy0zQXhvtxFYLgCLcBGAsYHQ/w593-h334/Screenshot20201007-08005600000.png)\n\n![MoreMilestones](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-JC3yBnYYpJo/X0kS-faP9oI/AAAAAAAAoII/xwDrvjv67mgHCSv-_b2up6VTRtqIM5x3wCLcBGAsYHQ/s640/Screenshot20200828-10004300000.png)\n\n![Update More Milestone](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-O-twuNYO0dA/X134iWuobDI/AAAAAAAAoOg/ZcKKfAWlIUgAZ7TJK8lSQoWgHPTsOatJgCLcBGAsYHQ/w625-h501/Sem%2Bt%25C3%25ADtulo.png)\n\n![Update More Milestone](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-239-TSlRwC0/X1I1FRdEH0I/AAAAAAAAoLk/ArCfIrNjL-c9eVtvsCxb8xPKxXtnogMdACLcBGAsYHQ/w625-h351/HighResScreenshot20200904-092913.png)\n\n![Milestones](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-tF_AbNM8-ms/Xy3yTrZozII/AAAAAAAAnzU/QDWGYgRmgJsm015eqnNrjxyOXDCxlIz9ACLcBGAsYHQ/s640/1.png)\n\n![Milestones](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-QeWsTUVvSgg/XzFQA1jriZI/AAAAAAAAn6Y/qTKlSxFPxNkdnE8qqDCh68kWoO4mhJi6wCLcBGAsYHQ/w640-h360/HighResScreenshot20200810-104717.png)\n\n![Milestones](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-BnaBiFVTsi0/XzfAxAymYxI/AAAAAAAAn70/S5gvyQ6T6UoZqZGXBa0FTSKTr8rS7dp0wCLcBGAsYHQ/s640/Screenshot20200814-10091600000.png)\n\n![Milestones](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-mzAQDh3UbFo/XzfAxBiJtAI/AAAAAAAAn7w/65EwG3ymt2EVMC9Sbe9W8vay64ZPgkIvwCLcBGAsYHQ/s640/Screenshot20200814-10130100000.png)\n\n\n![More Milestones](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-StTqpKTzT0A/X0J59xFh9aI/AAAAAAAAn_c/1S6uYTi117Q-2RkLMovUnNPr81yCiD8iQCLcBGAsYHQ/s640/Screenshot20200820-11112400000.png)\n\n![More Milestones](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Q1Gsi47q3m4/X0J5_b8oH-I/AAAAAAAAn_o/7sPR4wUNHwMtXVkl_qK2timGRWvVLU2_ACLcBGAsYHQ/s640/Screenshot20200823-11090500000.png)\n\nVisit our  **Wiki** : https://satisfactory-more-milestones-100-mod.fandom.com/\n\nSheet of the Milestones (Spoiler Alert): https://satisfactory-more-milestones-100-mod.fandom.com/wiki/Regular_Milestones\n\nSpecial Tier Theme :\n- Rubber industry ( part 1) (tier 28)\n-Light alloy ( tier 15)\n-Toxic Rafinery  (tier 45)\n-Rapid Rifle Industry  (tier 46)\n-Rubber mega industry ( part 2) (tier 45)\n- Wood Industry (tier 7 )\n-Chrome\\Cobalt Industry  (tier 56)\n-Uranium lovers + Road to the perfect fuel part 1 (tier 62)\n- Industrial factory ( tier70)\n- Coal factory ( tier 1)\n- Frostex ( Uranium Lovers part 2) ( Tier 63)\n\nComing Soon : \n\n- Impurity patch \n-Titanium patch\n\n---( Christmas break)---\n-Polishing patch\n-Freezing machine patch\n-Rubber industry part 3\n-Golden patch\n\n-Other special Alloy =)\nAnd more secret ^^\n-And way more!\n\n\n\n**LK Aice Video: +100 Milestones** \n\n[![LK AiceVideo](http://img.youtube.com/vi/OzPCMQtQ1D8/0.jpg)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OzPCMQtQ1D8)\n\n[![LK AiceVideo](http://img.youtube.com/vi/or_w-uXYqqs/0.jpg)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=or_w-uXYqqs)\n\n\n\n[![Contact Discord](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-xXhUBPlaJHw/Xy1WFMfsoxI/AAAAAAAAnzA/vfgPBMd6MugPwgMgvMpfCDM_MZYvCWxGACLcBGAsYHQ/s0/discord-logowordmark-color.png)](https://discord.gg/WQBz8HG)\n\n\nAny ideas / Suggestion / Need Some Help  / Bug Report : https://discord.gg/WQBz8HG\n\nIf you wanna support us with donation :  moremilestone100@gmail.com / [donate](https://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr?cmd=_donations&business=Moremilestone100%40gmail.com&item_name=More+Milestones+%2B100+&currency_code=USD&source=url)\n\n-\n\nIcon by Deantendo#4265 - https://discordapp.com/channels/555424930502541343/701160102077530213\n\n\n\n	https://storage-staging.ficsit.app/file/smr-staging-s3/images/mods/2fHYVfB2aDoEQ4/logo.webp		EQJ9s1Mn1NWvzJ	t	651	5	5	15	f	2021-02-04 17:27:17.304144+00	moremilestones	f	\N	f	f	6qYJFwb2x7hzenh9h2aHqGeGdw6313AJ
