C33gfrunXXTFpb	2023-01-17 01:50:34.528362+00	2026-04-11 00:00:00.089812+00	\N	Throughput Counter and Limiter	Belt attachment that displays the actual item throughput per minute. Can optionally limit the IPM.	Adds a conveyor belt attachment that counts and displays the actual item throughput per minute and can optionally limit the number of items allowed per minute. Unlocked via a Tier 2 Milestone in the HUB.\n\n<img  src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/deantendo/community/master/com_mp_yes.png"   /> <br>\n---\n**NOTE**\n\nBecause this calculates the actual "Items Per Minute", it takes up to **2 minutes to see an accurate readout**. If the number doesn't appear correct at first, wait a few minutes and check again.\n\n---\n\nWorks with all vanilla belt speeds, but not guaranteed to work with faster belts.\n\nWhen first placing the Counter Limiter, there will be no limit set (shown as -1). If you want to set one, simply interact with it and adjust the Throughput Limit.\n\n<img  src="https://i.imgur.com/0nx2rJ4.jpeg"  alt="" width="800"  /> <br>\n<img  src="https://i.imgur.com/5l4G7MB.jpeg"  alt="" width="800"  /> <br>\n<img  src="https://i.imgur.com/bI3vAmA.jpeg"  alt="" width="800"  /> <br>\n<img  src="https://i.imgur.com/7Pna3R0.jpeg"  alt="" width="800"  /> <br>\n<img  src="https://i.imgur.com/D8UIXH6.jpeg"  alt="" width="800"  /> <br>\n\n<br><br>**Please report any issues <a href="https://discord.gg/WM5KT7pVu8">on my Discord server</a>**<br><br>\n<a href="https://ko-fi.com/sirdigbymodding">SirDigby's completely optional tip jar</a><br>\n\n<br>**Mod Logo by Deantendo#4265**\n\n<a href="https://www.paypal.com/donate?hosted_button_id=H5NRHB2NFWUPQ">Care to tip Deantendo?</a>\n\n\n\n	https://storage-staging.ficsit.app/file/smr-staging-s3/images/mods/C33gfrunXXTFpb/logo.webp		6h8uF1DZHRYNoE	t	836	4	9	157	f	2023-12-18 17:16:44.406138+00	CounterLimiter	f	\N	f	f	5NYFBwIHiId4hnmGd1eoF7iJeAS3t3IP
A4fQCdXZeFEjrE	2024-10-07 23:30:10.387083+00	2026-04-11 00:00:00.11384+00	\N	SkyUI	Time Perception Configurator	<h1><strong>SkyUI: Temporal Perception Configurator</strong></h1>\n<p>A mod that allows you to control <strong>Time</strong> and <strong>Weather</strong>.</p>\n<p>This mod is <strong>MULITPLAYER COMPATIBLE</strong></p>\n<p>Install the mod and open the UI with the Open UI hotkey (default is <strong>Control + L</strong>, but can be re-bound in the main menu). The keybind must be changed if you are using this mod with <strong>SatisfactoryPlus</strong>, the default keybind of <strong>Control + L</strong> is reserved by <strong>SatisfactoryPlus</strong>!</p>\n<p>There is also a chat command to open the UI. Open the chat window with the <strong>Enter</strong> key and type <strong>/SkyUI_Open</strong><br /><br />The Weather Control buttons <strong>DO NOT WORK</strong> in U8 yet, this feature will be fixed at a later time!<br /><br />There is no need to unlock anything. Enjoy!<br /><br />More features will be added in future updates.&nbsp;<br /><br /><img src="https://i.imgur.com/lZ4ss9U.png" alt="" /></p>\n<p><br /><video controls="controls" width="900" height="450">\n<source src="https://i.imgur.com/jcD1dJa.mp4" type="video/mp4" /></video></p>\n<p>Mod by <strong>D4rkL0rd#9248</strong> and <strong>Deantendo#4265</strong></p>\n<p><strong>SkyUI Discord</strong><br /><a title="SkyUI Discord" href="https://discord.gg/6XjgbDaX6q"><img src="https://i.imgur.com/KY8wqGd.png" /></a></p>\n<p><br /><br /></p>			A7cgHRnADRaYyv	t	398	2	7	16	f	2024-10-07 23:30:46.697234+00	SkyUI	f	\N	f	f	\N
