4TJLGTqZibZADA	2021-08-01 16:07:19.559717+00	2026-04-11 00:00:00.132811+00	\N	PowerSuit	A powered Suit with an internal Inventory that allows Modules to modify the Bonuses the Suit provides.	<!-- # Test early releases for Update 8 on the [Discord](http://discord.gg/zqp6U7Y7Nu)! -->\n\n# PowerSuit\n\n_This mod is now maintained by Robb, please contact him instead of Nog with questions._\n_If you enjoy my work, please consider donating to my [completely optional tip jar](https://ko-fi.com/robb4)._\n\nPlease report bugs on [on the Nog's Mods Discord](https://discord.gg/JjngemP9A4) or [on GitHub](https://github.com/Nogg-aholic/PowerSuit/issues) (slower response).\n\n**This mod should fully work in Multiplayer.**\n\nThis mod is a **library mod** that adds "suit" back slot equipment items with inventories, and "equipment module descriptors." Modules placed in the inner inventory of the Suit can influence the bonuses it provides, or execute their own custom code. Before more body slots were base game, this mod was the go-to choice. Now, this mod allows for advanced custom equipment items.\n\n### !! This mod itself does not add any Modules, nor any Suits! You will have to install other mods for that. !!\n\nTo find Modules and Suits, check out the PowerSuit Modules mods:\n\n[![ArmorModules](https://i.imgur.com/Wn72bpo.png)](https://ficsit.app/mod/ArmorModules)\n\n[![Modpack All PowerSuit Modules](https://i.imgur.com/rJ5t9u1.png)](https://ficsit.app/mod/ArmorModules__Modpack_All)\n\n## Mod Spotlights\n\nCheck out **LK Aice**'s playlists of mod spotlights below, in English or German. Thanks!\n\n[![EnglishVideo](https://img.youtube.com/vi/tKJHJqCniqo/mqdefault.jpg)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tKJHJqCniqo)\n[![GermanVideo](https://img.youtube.com/vi/9Lb9F3MTqBo/mqdefault.jpg)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9Lb9F3MTqBo)\n\nCheck out **direwolf20** trying out the mod in his Let's Play: _(videos slightly out of date)_\n\n[![direwolf20 1](https://i.imgur.com/ooJZyLM.png)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tg4mVtjk9L0)\n[![direwolf20 2](https://i.imgur.com/T4yYrGU.png)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIxyhHo-Y70)\n[![direwolf20 3](https://i.imgur.com/NzlhATq.png)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w0IdiGbPCws)\n\n<details>\n<summary> Outdated Videos </summary>\n\nThe mod has changed _drastically_ since the below videos were released, but you may still find them valuable to watch:\n\n_Check out an old version of the mod on the Update 4 Launch Stream!_\n\n[![Update 4 Launch Stream - Modding Segment](https://i.imgur.com/uHOWRWV.png)](https://youtu.be/Gdz6SUv9Om4?t=11384)\n\n**Thank you Random Gamer and TotalXclipse!**\n\nHere are some videos of Random Gamer exploring the mod in his singleplayer series.\n\n[![Newer Random Gamer Video](https://i.imgur.com/J8N04xw.png)](https://youtu.be/x12-zC7d61Y?t=140)\n\n[![Random Gamer Video](https://i.imgur.com/MXUp0tJ.png)](https://youtu.be/1Q7uDSOHZTo?t=588)\n\nEven older videos:\n\n**TotalXclipse**\n\n[![TotalXclipse Video](https://i.imgur.com/RGnJQRU.png)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4JMTp2kC-oY)\n\n**Random Gamer**\n\n[![Random Gamer Video](https://i.imgur.com/WwqChWg.png)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FRMOZ18eSc4)\n\n</details>\n\n## Controls\n\nKeybinds can be adjusted in the base-game Keybind Menu.\n\nNote that some controls will not do anything unless you have a module that grants you that ability.\n\nThe default controls are:\n\n* Hold Space to activate Fly Mode\n* Hold "Space" to ascend\n* Hold "Shift" to accelerate directionally (obeys base game Toggle Sprint settings)\n* Hold "C" to descend or apply brakes\n* Press "G" to toggle gravity flight mode\n* Press "K" to toggle frictionless flight mode\n* Press "Ctrl+Shift+M" to show your mouse cursor anywhere\n  * You can use this to free your cursor if another mod messes it up\n  * Allows you to view tooltips on HUD elements\n* Press "Ctrl+L" to switch to 3rd Person Camera\n  * Does _not_ need SML cheats enabled\n  * Hand equipment animations are slightly buggy\n* Press "Right-Alt" to open the PowerSuit Config Window\n  * Config Window can be resized by dragging the bottom right corner\n  * Config Window can be dragged and moved on screen by grabbing the Title\n\n## Showcase\n\nFor a more detailed description of suits' functions and modes, see the [PowerSuit Modules mod page](https://ficsit.app/mod/ArmorModules).\n\n![Suit](https://i.imgur.com/7wMwefa.png)\n\nWhen equipped, the Suit's inner Inventory can be found in the player's inventory below their hand slots. ( This is using NogsPowersuit )\n\n![UI](https://i.imgur.com/0aVcpb7.png)\n\n![Overlay](https://i.imgur.com/BzcsBDY.png)\n\n![FlightController](https://i.imgur.com/MsweUXe.png)\nFuse and Overdraw\n\nIf your suit runs out of power, you will enter Overdraw. The HUD's Fuse Indicator light will turn orange, your handheld controllers will gain a red warning background, and their Overdraw progress bar will begin to increase. While Overdrawing, you can consume an unlimited amount of power, but if you are still out of power when the Overdraw progress bar reaches the maximum, your suit will have to Reboot.\n\nOverdraw\n![Overdraw](https://i.imgur.com/DuTiMrk.png)\n\nRebooting\n\nWhen your suit begins to reboot, all of your installed Modules will cease to function, and you must wait for the suit to reboot again before you can use them. This is certainly not advantageous while flying, or in a dangerous environment, so consider investing in modules that increase your Power Capacity or Power Generation.\n\n![Reboot](https://i.imgur.com/y3AaZBe.png)\n\nOriginal Author: Nog#6605\n\nCurrent Maintainer: Robb#6731\n\nIcons & UI Art by deantendo#4265\n\nAssets Used:\n[Freepik](http://www.freepik.com) - Designed by macrovector_official\n	https://storage-staging.ficsit.app/file/smr-staging-s3/images/mods/4TJLGTqZibZADA/logo.webp		EnpaLRia9zKS9S	t	860	3	14	298	f	2023-12-22 07:48:27.606767+00	PowerSuit	f	{"EA": {"Note": "", "State": "Works"}, "EXP": {"Note": "", "State": "Damaged"}}	f	f	zAcGDwIIh1d1dnqGeSaXWJh2lpwJ+IoA
7DuJty1GiWBGGP	2024-10-08 01:32:17.382775+00	2026-04-11 00:00:00.112382+00	\N	BlueprintZooper_test	Zoop vanilla Blueprint! 1.0 test	Test description<br>\nDefault Input Keys\n* NumPad3 : Increase Zoop Y amount\n* NumPad2 : Decrease Zoop Y amount\n* NumPad9 : Increase Zoop X amount\n* NumPad5 : Decrease Zoop X amount\n* NumPad7 : Increase Zoop Z amount\n* NumPad4 : Decrease Zoop Z amount\n* Hold Numpad.(point) + each numpad: Increase|Decrease XYZ Offset\n* NumPad1 : Reset\n* NumPad0 : Force Re-calculate hologram\n* NumPad6 : Rotate Blueprint Clockwise\n* NumPad8 : Rotate Blueprint Counter Clockwise\n\nThis mod allow you to zoop vanilla blueprints. <br>\nTo activate zoop, <b> you need to Nudge(Press H) blueprint.</B> <br>\nThen Press each numpad to set zoop amount.\n\nAfter set zoop amount, simply left click to build them all.\n\nYou can change offset amount and others in config.\n\n## Note: When you use Infinite Nudge mod and rotate hologram pitch and yaw, It will not affect to zooped hologram. Also Press Numpad0 to force calculate hologram point when nudging with arrow key.\n\n<hr>\n\nIf you have problem, ping "Almine" in "Satisfactory Modding Server" on Discord.			EF77pzkHf2c6tf	t	131	2	5	4	f	2024-10-08 01:44:34.666041+00	BlueprintZooper	f	{"EA": {"Note": "", "State": "Works"}, "EXP": {"Note": "", "State": "Works"}}	f	f	\N
5k1WcXjobJKCdU	2024-10-08 13:50:32.974047+00	2026-03-02 11:44:00.076233+00	\N	Useful Liquid Biofuel	Makes liquid biofuel useful as an early game fuel source	# General Concept:\nLiquid biofuel is a fuel source, and such its only use is either in a fuel generator or packaged in vehicles. But by the time you get access to either of those you already have access to proper oil based fuels and thus liquid biofuel is useless.\n\nThis mod strives to make Liquid Biofuel an early game fuel source by unlocking fuel generators and packagers much earlier. This will offer an interesting alternative to the coal power in the early game, Coal can still be fully automated where Biomass collection cant so that is a choice you got to make. If you do end up going for an early Fuel Generators setup you can hook them up to oil based fuels later when you get access to them.\n\n### This mod alters the following:\n##### New building: Mixer\nAllows water to be mixed with a solid to create a liquid, this can be used to mix the following recipes:\n* `Water` + `Solid Biofuel` -> `Liquid Biofuel`\n* `Water` + `Sulfur` -> `Sulfuric Acid`\n* `Water` + `Bauxite` -> `Alumina Solution` *\n  * *after unlocking the `Sloppy Alumina` alternative recipe\n\n##### Tier 2\nAdds a new Milestone at the end `Biofuel Processing` this milestone will let you build a `Water Extractor`, `Pipes`,  `Fuel Generator` and the `Mixer`. These buildings allow you to turn your `Solid Biofuel` into `Liquid Biofuel` that can be burned in the generator.\n\n##### Tier 3\nExtends `Tier 3: Vehicular Transport` with a `Biodegradable Canister` (build in the constructor) and `Packager` so you can now power your early vehicles on `Packaged Liquid Biofuel`. Unlocking this milestone will also allow the `Coated Iron Canister` and `Steel Canister` alternative recipes to be researched.\n\n##### Other changes:\n * Alters the build costs of a `Fuel Generator` to resources available in Tier 2.\n * Alters the build costs of a `Packager` to resources available in Tier 3.\n * Improves the energy value of `Liquid Biofuel` from 750 MJ/m3 to 1125 MJ/m3.\n * Unlocking `Turbo Fuel` in the `MAM`, will also add a `Liquid Biofuel` based `Turbo Fuel` recipe to the `Blender`\n * Unlocking `Gas Nobelisk` in the `MAM`, will also add a `Liquid Biofuel` based `Gas Nobelisk` recipe to the `Blender`\n\n**TODO:** The new mixer building uses the model of a packager, i want to replace this in the future, but haven't found anyone able to model it yet	https://storage-staging.ficsit.app/file/smr-staging-s3/images/mods/5k1WcXjobJKCdU/logo.webp	https://github.com/Jarno458/UsefulLiquidBiofuelMod	4dHSCBKQ8pAo4X	t	12	5	0	0	f	\N	UsefulLiquidBiofuel	f	{"EA": {"Note": "", "State": "Works"}, "EXP": {"Note": "", "State": "Works"}}	f	f	TgiCBQA2JslvUcG9VlhagIz5B5inV4Z5Zg==
7x6dRqH8wrH8cj	2021-08-19 23:17:25.909283+00	2025-12-10 21:28:00.050889+00	\N	Small Storage Container	do stuff with the thing	<h1>Small Storage Container</h1>\n\nThis is a compact, stackable and paintable storage container with a fully functional vanilla Storage UI, an 8 slot inventory, a belt input and an output.\n\nThe Small Storage Container is unlocked automatically and can be found in the build menu under Organization > Storage.\n\nYou can edit the inventory size of small storage containers from the Main Menu>Mods>SmallStorage, or from the config file located at \\<gameinstall\\>\\FactoryGame\\Configs\\SmallStorage.cfg . This counts as cheating and one day you will have to answer for your crimes.\n\n<b>REGARDING MANUAL INSTALLATION: </b> First of all, just don't. Use the <a href="https://smm.ficsit.app/">Mod Manager</a> instead. If you insist on manual installation you also need to install <a href="https://ficsit.app/mod/gvJKni1VJQ1Cc">this mod</a>. If you are using the mod manager, it will download this dependency for you automatically.\n\n<img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/deantendo/community/master/com_mp_yes.png">\n\nFully compatible with multiplayer.\n\n<h3>Contact</h3>\n\nYou can find me on the <a href="https://discord.gg/xkVJ73E">ficsit.app modding discord</a> (Avery#5241) if you have any feedback or bug reports.\n\n<h3>Credit</h3>\n\nModel and texture assets 'ethically recycled'™ from the Coffee Stain Studios' dumpsters\n\nIcon by Deantendo#4265\n\n<h3>Media</h3>\n\n<img src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/623891487683510323/758890513734172672/unknown.png"/>			2qRuVNnRPN82RW	t	365	3	0	0	f	\N	SmallStorage	f	{"EA": {"Note": "", "State": "Works"}, "EXP": {"Note": "Broken by Update 8", "State": "Broken"}}	f	f	\N
274FyJPk16RnRs	2021-02-04 10:48:10.27038+00	2026-04-11 00:00:00.09941+00	\N	Initial Bus Quickstart	Ficsit is been awesome to you and is sending some materials to quickstart. 	![Aquila Industrial](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-NU9r_AxMnXA/YBcy-lloznI/AAAAAAAAp3I/YUSDKoxLqFwXdtSInjmq2yEI5l8W2XApACLcBGAsYHQ/w640-h64/Aquila_Industrial.png)\n\nFicsit is been awesome to you and send some materials to quickstart. \n\n\n**Unique item.**\n-\n\n\nYou will get for 1 hour (then it auto destructs):\n-\n- Energy 200MW\n-Iron Ingot\n-Plate\n-Rod\n-Screw\n-Copper Ingot\n-Wire\n-Copper Sheet\n-Coal\n-Biofuel\n-Limestone\n-Concrete\n-Cable\n\nYou will get the Cheap Smart Splitter to manage the materials too. (DEPENDENCY)\n\nTries to produce materials and energy until you get your initial factory going... \n\n![](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-MecRxmB0Efs/YBmbwOK0oAI/AAAAAAAAp4A/cuFnjA5q6a4CIhYp3RkMybyRyAwTKa4UwCLcBGAsYHQ/w640-h360/Screenshot20210202-15065800000.png) \n\n![](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-ylH2IsJNGk0/YBmd6NcnOAI/AAAAAAAAp4U/1D8DZyqdQ0AHekWYe8_C9Mbwo-n_MfqLACLcBGAsYHQ/w640-h570/103.png)\n\n![](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/--uxsyqrjgNU/YBmd6BMqw1I/AAAAAAAAp4Y/npSMTnsctuQyU9eXuVqrbZZhAmM0RKZ1QCLcBGAsYHQ/w640-h536/102.png)\n\n![](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-7dwmiSggKtg/YBmd6AUKteI/AAAAAAAAp4Q/_F7VFaYteLsu2r52wwHuOIf4YIMeJpJJQCLcBGAsYHQ/w640-h270/104.png)\n\nAn old idea from Factorio Mods\n\n![](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-PueUhPsAJR8/YBmbtNLNAjI/AAAAAAAAp38/YF_9j--0jmIIjAB202drEwJtXDPq_S6JgCLcBGAsYHQ/w640-h384/100.png)\n\nAny ideas / Suggestion / Need Some Help  / Bug Report :\n\n[![Contact Discord](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-xXhUBPlaJHw/Xy1WFMfsoxI/AAAAAAAAnzA/vfgPBMd6MugPwgMgvMpfCDM_MZYvCWxGACLcBGAsYHQ/s0/discord-logowordmark-color.png)](https://discord.gg/TteyUNs)\n\nIcon /UIs and Graphic Advices by **Deantendo#4265** - https://discordapp.com/channels/555424930502541343/701160102077530213\n\nI'm having a lot of fun making Satisfactory Mods and I hope you are enjoying them! If you want to [donate](https://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr?cmd=_s-xclick&hosted_button_id=U96NB4W469FR2&source=url), i would be very grateful.\n\nSupport Andre Aquila\n-\n[![Aquila](https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/715598550309797999/739846021768675448/paypal_lg.jpg)](https://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr?cmd=_s-xclick&hosted_button_id=U96NB4W469FR2&source=url)\n\n[![Aquila](https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-lzOvlrTFQ50/X_2SZ43UrYI/AAAAAAAApkg/sb59ljSP-Jc9o2GDN_3uDmQIhe6-AgmtACLcBGAsYHQ/w177-h59/5483255-patreon-logo-support-my-videos-on-patreon-transparent-png-patreon-logo-transparent-820_273_preview.png)](https://www.patreon.com/AndreAquila)\n\n			EQJ9s1Mn1NWvzJ	t	384	2	4	10	f	2021-02-04 10:48:20.017611+00	InitialBus	f	\N	f	f	\N
3FdP3UPjFbhd5C	2024-10-08 12:24:04.435242+00	2026-04-11 00:00:00.119786+00	\N	Automatic Biofuel Processor	Automatically processes organic materials into Solid Biofuel.	Automatically processes organic materials into Solid Biofuel. It keeps the original ratios.\n\nYou dont need feed the items in any specific order, it will automatically calculate how many leaves, woods, etc you are fedding it, providing the solid biofuels.\n\nProcesses:\n-\n- 4 Leaves x 1 Solid Biofuel\n- 2 Wood x 5 Solid Biofuel\n- 2 Mycelia x 1 Solid Biofuel\n- 1 Alien Protein x 50 Solid Biofuel\n- 1 Hog Remais x 50 Solid Biofuel\n- 1 Spitter Remais x 50 Solid Biofuel\n- 1 Hatcher Remais x 50 Solid Biofuel\n- 1 Stinger Remais x 50 Solid Biofuel\n- 1 Solid Biofuel x 1 Solid Biofuel\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/K30rjTH.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/KvS2hRJ.png)\n\n\n\n<br/><img src="https://github.com/DellAquila/Layout/raw/main/Videos_Up.png"><br/>\n[![](http://img.youtube.com/vi/NzQsBMR9Pyo/0.jpg)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NzQsBMR9Pyo)\n<br/><img src="https://github.com/DellAquila/Layout/raw/main/Videos_Down.png"><br/> \n\n\n\n	https://storage-staging.ficsit.app/file/smr-staging-s3/images/mods/3FdP3UPjFbhd5C/logo.webp		EQJ9s1Mn1NWvzJ	t	170	3	9	19	f	2024-10-08 12:39:54.447656+00	AutoSolidBioFuel	f	{"EA": {"Note": "", "State": "Works"}, "EXP": {"Note": "", "State": "Works"}}	f	f	HAiGDQQem9mPiG5md9ZBYAlGKDiHh4B1GA==
7uZoFCUgz8fxVe	2023-12-18 17:16:04.701253+00	2026-04-11 00:00:00.072386+00	\N	Alternate Recipe Research	Choose which Alternate Recipe to research with your hard-earned hard drives	Adds 6 research trees to the MAM where you can research Alternate Recipes. \n\nEach tree has a milestone tier associated with it, and all milestones for that tier need to be completed in order for the research tree to be unlocked. \n\nEach research node will cost at least 1 hard drive and some may also require 1 of 1-3 other items. The additional items are intended to match the same requirements that would need to be met before you would be able to obtain the Alternate Recipe through standard Hard Drive research.\n\nFor example, in order to get the Alternate Recipe for Caterium Wire, which lets you craft Wire from Caterium Ingots, you will need to pay 1 Caterium Ingot in addtion to a Hard Drive to "prove" you have unlocked that portion of the Caterium Research tree.\n\nWhen you first load the game after installing this mod you may see a "Schematic Unlocked" message, this is simply bringing the new Research Trees up to date with any Alternate Recipes you've already unlocked.\n\n<br><br>\nThere are a lot of Alternate Recipes, so if I missed any or something seems wrong our out of place please don't hesitate to contact me on Discord.\n\n<br><br>**Please report any issues <a href="https://discord.gg/WM5KT7pVu8">on my Discord server</a>**<br><br>\n<a href="https://ko-fi.com/sirdigbymodding">SirDigby's completely optional tip jar</a><br><br>\n<br>\n**Mod Icon by Deantendo#4265**\n\n<a href="https://www.paypal.com/donate?hosted_button_id=H5NRHB2NFWUPQ">Care to tip Deantendo?</a>\n\n<br><br>			6h8uF1DZHRYNoE	t	368	5	6	67	f	2023-12-18 17:18:32.171814+00	AltRecipeResearch	f	\N	f	f	\N
