cal processes involving Massage-2(AB)b organisms and atmosphere.\\r\\n\\r\\nDoes not require fuel to operate.\\r\\nProvides 20 MW Power Capacity.\\r\\nProduces 20 MW.\\r\\nStacks with other modules of the same type.","mDisplayName":"","mItemCategory":"Cat_GenerationModules_C","mPersistentBigIcon":"Icon_BioReactor","mSmallIcon":"Icon_BioReactor"}]},"Generation/Module_DirtyReactor.uexp":{"ModuleClass_BaseModule_C":[{"EquipmentStats":{"nSuitProperties":null},"mDescription":"DANGER - Radioactive! Be prepared when crafting this.\\r\\nA hideously unsafe nuclear reactor designed to be created before further nuclear research is completed. Hopefully FICSIT is willing to overlook some safety concerns to let this one slide.\\r\\n\\r\\nRemains radioactive (to a lesser degree) when installed in a suit. \\r\\nHaving more than 2 installed will cause radiation damage.\\r\\nCrouching or sliding may result in radiation exposure for the duration.\\r\\nDoes not require fuel to operate.\\r\\nProvides 20 MW Power Capacity.\\r\\nProduces 70 MW.\\r\\nStacks with other modules of the same type.","mDisplayName":"","mItemCategory":"Cat_GenerationModules_C","mPersistentBigIcon":"Icon_DirtyReactor","mRadioactiveDecay":1,"mSmallIcon":"Icon_DirtyReactor"}]},"Generation/Module_HypertubeChargingCoils.uexp":{"ModuleClass_BaseModule_C":[{"EquipmentStats":{"nFuelConsumptionInState":null,"nPowerProductionInState":null,"nSpeedInState":null,"nSuitProperties":null},"mDescription":"Uses induction charging to charge your PowerSuit from your base's electric network while riding in Hyper Tubes. The system slightly interferes with boosting abilities.\\r\\nBalance WIP.\\r\\n\\r\\n(Does not yet actually cause a power draw on your base)\\r\\nProduces 300 MW and refills your fuel tank at a slow rate when riding in a Hypertube.\\r\\nDecreases max Hypertube boost speed by 5 m/s.\\r\\nIncreases power consumption by 25% when accelerating or decelerating in a hypertube.\\r\\nStacks with other modules of the same type."