ent speed speed.\\r\\n\\r\\nReduces power capacity by 15MW.\\r\\nIncreases ascent speed by 50%.\\r\\nIncreases descent speed by 15%.\\r\\nIncreases power consumption by:\\r\\n   25% when ascending.\\r\\n   15% when air boosting.\\r\\nIncreases Fuel consumption by:\\r\\n   33% when ascending.\\r\\n   10% when air boosting.\\r\\nStacks with other modules of the same type.","mDisplayName":"","mItemCategory":"Cat_FlightModules_C","mPersistentBigIcon":"Icon_AirAscent","mSmallIcon":"Icon_AirAscent"}]},"Mobility/Module_AirSprintMk1.uexp":{"ModuleClass_BaseModule_C":[{"EquipmentStats":{"nFuelConsumptionInState":null,"nPowerProductionInState":null,"nSpeedInState":null,"nSuitProperties":null},"mDescription":"Additional thrusters to increase maximum air boosting speed (sprinting while flying) and general flight speed.\\r\\n\\r\\nReduces power capacity by 20MW.\\r\\nIncreases max speed in all flying states.\\r\\nConsumes:\\r\\n   5MW when hovering.\\r\\n   15MW when flying.\\r\\n   25MW when air boosting.\\r\\nIncreases Fuel consumption by 20% when air boosting.\\r\\nStacks with other modules of the same type.","mDisplayName":"","mItemCategory":"Cat_FlightModules_C","mPersistentBigIcon":"Icon_HorizontalAirspeed","mSmallIcon":"Icon_HorizontalAirspeed"}]},"Mobility/Module_ExoskeletonMk1.uexp":{"ModuleClass_BaseModule_C":[{"EquipmentStats":{"nMovementComponentStats":{"MaxWalkSpeed":200,"mMaxSprintSpeed":450},"nPowerProductionInState":null,"nSuitProperties":null},"mDescription":"Additional servos to increase your speed both when walking and sprinting.\\r\\n\\r\\nReduces power capacity by 30MW.\\r\\nConsumes 15MW when walking and sprinting.\\r\\nBoosts sprinting speed by 4.5 m/s.\\r\\nBoosts walking speed by 2 m/s.\\r\\nStacks with other modules of the same type.","mDisplayName":"","mItemCategory":"Cat_GroundModules_C","mPersistentBigIcon":"Icon_YellowShinyLegs","mSmallIcon":"Icon_YellowShinyLegs"}]},"Mobility/Module_FuelSprintMk1.uexp":{"ModuleClass_BaseModule_C":[{"EquipmentStats":{"nEmptyFuelPowerPenaltyInState":null,"nFuelConsumptionInState":null,"nMovementComponentStats":{"mMaxSprintSpeed":1500},"nPowerProductionInState":null},"mDescription":"Fuel-powered, rocket-propelled Blade Runners are sure to get you where you're going quickly, as long as there aren't any walls in the way.\\r\\nBalance WIP\\r\\n\\r\\nReduces power capacity by 10MW.\\r\\nConsumes 10MW when sprinting.\\r\\nConsumes Fuel when sprinting.\\r\\nBoosts sprinting speed by 15 m/s.\\r\\nNote: Running out of fuel drastically increases power consumption, but does not prevent you from boosting.\\r\\nStacks with other modules of the same type.","mDisplayName":"","mItemCategory":"Cat_GroundModules_C","mPersistentBigIcon":"Icon_FuelRunners","mSmallIcon":"Icon_FuelRunners"}]},"Mobility/Module_GroundSprintMk1.uexp":{"ModuleClass_BaseModule_C":[{"EquipmentStats":{"nMovementComponentStats":{"mMaxSprintSpeed":450},"nPowerProductionInState":null},"mDescription":"Additional servos to increase your speed when sprinting.\\r\\n\\r\\nReduces power capacity by 10MW.\\r\\nConsumes 10MW when sprinting.\\r\\nBoosts sprinting speed by 4.5 m/s\\r\\nStacks with other modules of the same type.","mDisplayName":"","mItemCategory":"Cat_GroundModules_C","mPersistentBigIcon":"Icon_GreenLegs","mSmallIcon":"Icon_GreenLegs"}]},"Mobility/Module_GroundWalkMk1.uexp":{"ModuleClass_BaseModule_C":[{"EquipmentStats":{"nMovementComponentStats":{"MaxWalkSpeed":200},"nPowerProductionInState":null},"mDescription":"Additional servos to increase your speed when walking.\\r\\n\\r\\nReduces power capacity by 10MW.\\r\\nConsumes 10MW when walking.\\r\\nBoosts walking speed by 2 m/s.\\r\\nStacks with other modules of the same type.","mDisplayName":"","mItemCategory":"Cat_GroundModules_C","mPersistentBigIcon":"Icon_OrangeLegs","mSmallIcon":"Icon_OrangeLegs"}]},"Mobility/Module_IntegratedBladeRunners.uexp":{"ModuleClass_UniqueModule_C":[{"EquipmentStats":{"nDamageTypeResistance":null,"nMovementComponentStats":{"JumpZVelocity":300,"mMaxSprintSpeed":450},"nPowerProductionInState":null},"mDescription":"A set of Blader Runners built into your suit.\\r\\nRoughly the same stats as vanilla Blade Runners.\\r\\n\\r\\nReduces power capacity by 10MW.\\r\\nConsumes 10MW when sprinting.\\r\\nBoosts sprinting speed by 50%.\\r\\nIncreases the distance you can fall before taking fall damage. (WIP)\\r\\nIncreases jump height.\\r\\nInstalling more than one has no effect.","mDisplayName":"","mItemCategory":"Cat_GroundModules_C","mPersistentBigIcon":"Icon_Legs","mSmallIcon":"Icon_Legs"}]},"Mobility/Module_IntegratedJetpack.uexp":{"ModuleClass_UniqueModule_C":[{"EquipmentStats":{"SuitFlags":52,"nDampeningCurve":"Curve_JetpackStandard","nEmptyFuelPowerPenaltyInState":null,"nFuelConsumptionInState":null,"nPowerProductionInState":null,"nSpeedInState":null,"nSuitProperties":null},"mDescription":"A fuel-powered suit Hover Jetpack especially helpful for building.\\r\\nWill keep your height consistent as you fly and slow you to a stop when not pressing movement keys.\\r\\nHold Space to ascend, press Ctrl-Space (or land) to stop flying. Press sprint to boost or Left Alt to descend. \\r\\nRuns on all Fuels your Suit accepts.\\r\\n\\r\\nGrants the ability to fly with your powersuit.\\r\\nReduces power capacity by 10 MW.\\r\\nConsumes base 30 MW while hovering.\\r\\n\\r\\nConstantly consumes Fuel as you fly (see note).\\r\\nLand on the ground to refill your Fuel tank using items in your inventory.\\r\\nFuel bar can NOT refill midair - additional modules required.\\r\\n\\r\\nFuel and power are consumed at an increased rate while moving and boosting.\\r\\nNote: Running out of fuel drastically increases power consumption, but does not prevent you from flying.\\r\\nInstalling more than one has no effect.","mDisplayName":"","mItemCategory":"Cat_FlightModules_C","mPersistentBigIcon":"Icon_HoverJetpack","mSmallIcon":"Icon_HoverJetpack"}]},"Mobility/Module_IntegratedSmoothJetpack.uexp":{"ModuleClass_UniqueModule_C":[{"EquipmentStats":{"SuitFlags":4,"nDampeningCurve":"Curve_JetpackZeroDampening","nEmptyFuelPowerPenaltyInState":null,"nFuelConsumptionInState":null,"nPowerProductionInState":null,"nSpeedInState":null,"nSuitProperties":null},"mDescription":"A fuel-powered suit Jetpack to aide with exploration.\\r\\nRoughly the same ascent power and flight time (in a Mk1 suit without additional generators) as the Vanilla jetpack.\\r\\nHold space to ascend. Press sprint to boost. Press Left Alt while flying to make a powered descent.\\r\\nRuns on all Fuels your Suit accepts.\\r\\n\\r\\nGrants the ability to fly with your PowerSuit.\\r\\nReduces power capacity by 10 MW.\\r\\nConsumes base 35 MW while flying.\\r\\n\\r\\nLand on the ground to refill your Fuel tank using items in your inventory.\\r\\nFuel bar can NOT refill midair - additional modules required.\\r\\n\\r\\nFuel and power are consumed at an increased rate while moving and boosting.\\r\\nConstantly consumes Fuel as you fly. Running out of fuel drastically increases power consumption, but does not prevent you from flying.\\r\\nInstalling more than one has no effect.","mDisplayName":"","mItemCategory":"Cat_FlightModules_C","mPersistentBigIcon":"Icon_Jetpack","mSmallIcon":"Icon_Jetpack"}]},"Mobility/Module_LadderClimbMk1.uexp":{"ModuleClass_BaseModule_C":[{"EquipmentStats":{"nMovementComponentStats":{"mClimbSpeed":3000},"nPowerProductionInState":null,"nSuitProperties":null},"mDescription":"Uses the power of magnets to accelerate your ladder climbing rate.\\r\\nWIP - Seems to be capped at +1m/s?\\r\\n \\r\\nIncreases ladder climb rate by 100% of base.\\r\\nReduces power capacity by 20MW.\\r\\nConsumes 5 MW when walking or climbing a ladder.\\r\\nStacks with other modules of the same type.","mDisplayName":"","mItemCategory":"Cat_GroundModules_C","mPersistentBigIcon":"Icon_LadderClimbMk1","mSmallIcon":"Icon_LadderClimbMk1"}]},"Mobility/Module_MidairRefuel.uexp":{"ModuleClass_UniqueModule_C":[{"EquipmentStats":{"SuitFlags":64,"nFuelConsumptionInState":null,"nPowerProductionInState":null,"nSuitProperties":null},"mDescription":"Allows your PowerSuit's fuel tank to refill while flying. \\r\\n\\r\\nReduces power capacity by 10 MW.\\r\\n10% increased power consumption when flying.\\r\\n10% increased Fuel consumption when flying.\\r\\n-33% Fuel transfer speed.\\r\\nInstalling more than one has no effect.","mDisplayName":"","mItemCategory":"Cat_FlightModules_C","mPersistentBigIcon":"Icon_MidairRefuel","mSmallIcon":"Icon_MidairRefuel"}]},"Mobility/Module_SlideAngleMk1.uexp":{"ModuleClass_BaseModule_C":[{"EquipmentStats":{"SuitFlags":128,"nEmptyFuelPowerPenaltyInState":null,"nFuelConsumptionInState":null,"nMovementComponentStats":{"mMaxSlideAngle":0.1309},"nPowerProductionInState":null,"nSpeedInState":null},"mDescription":"Totally radical! Sliding any place, any time.\\r\\nPress Left Alt while sliding to power slide (consumes fuel).\\r\\n\\r\\nAllows you to passively slide forever at 9 m/s.\\r\\nReduces power capacity by 10MW.\\r\\nConsumes 15 MW when slide boosting.\\r\\n+10 m/s (roughly) power slide speed\\r\\nBase power slide speed is 16 m/s\\r\\nIncreases max slide angle by 7.5 degrees (0.1309 radians). \\r\\nWall climbing is unfortunately not possible.\\r\\nStacks with other modules of the same type; hilarity ensues.","mDisplayName":"","mItemCategory":"Cat_GroundModules_C","mPersistentBigIcon":"Icon_SlideAngle","mSmallIcon":"Icon_SlideAngle"}]},"Mobility/Module_StrongDampening.uexp":{"ModuleClass_BaseModule_C":[{"EquipmentStats":{"nFuelConsumptionInState":null,"nPowerProductionInState":null,"nSuitProperties":null},"mDescription":"**With the changes to dampening works, this module no longer really does anything. I'm still looking into how to possibly re-implement it in the future.**\\r\\nEffectively reduces maximum movement speed with the Hover Jetpack.\\r\\nAdds dampening to the Vanilla-Style Jetpack.\\r\\nBalance WIP\\r\\n\\r\\n+25% dampening multiplier\\r\\nConsequently decreases your max flight speed.\\r\\nIncreases the amount of time it takes for you to slow to a stop while flying.\\r\\n-25% energy consumption when air boosting.\\r\\n-10% energy consumption when flying and hovering.\\r\\n-20% fuel consumption when hovering and air boosting.\\r\\nReduces power capacity by 10MW.\\r\\nStacks with other modules of the same type.","mDisplayName":"","mItemCategory":"Cat_FlightModules_C","mPersistentBigIcon":"Icon_RedFlightComputer","mSmallIcon":"Icon_RedFlightComputer"}]},"Mobility/Module_ThrustBoots.uexp":{"ModuleClass_UniqueModule_C":[{"EquipmentStats":{"SuitFlags":4,"nDampeningCurve":"Curve_JetpackVanilla","nEmptyFuelPowerPenaltyInState":null,"nFuelConsumptionInState":null,"nMovementComponentStats":{"JumpZVelocity":100},"nPowerProductionInState":null,"nSpeedInState":null,"nSuitProperties":null},"mDescription":"","mDisplayName":"","mItemCategory":"Cat_FlightModules_C","mPersistentBigIcon":"Icon_ThrustBoots","mSmallIcon":"Icon_ThrustBoots"}]},"Mobility/Module_WeakDampening.uexp":{"ModuleClass_BaseModule_C":[{"EquipmentStats":{"nFuelConsumptionInState":null,"nPowerProductionInState":null,"nSuitProperties":null},"mDescription":"**With the changes to dampening works, this module no longer really does anything. I'm still looking into how to possibly re-implement it in the future.**\\r\\nEffectivley increases maximum movement speed with the Hover Jetpack and Thrust Boots. Has no effect on the Integrated Jetpack.\\r\\nBalance WIP\\r\\n\\r\\n-25% dampening multiplier\\r\\nConsequently increases your max flight speed.\\r\\nIncreases the amount of time it takes for you to slow to a stop while flying.\\r\\n+200% fuel consumption when flying.\\r\\n+400% fuel consumption when air boosting.\\r\\n+50% energy consumption when air boosting.\\r\\n+10% energy consumption when flying.\\r\\nReduces power capacity by 10MW.\\r\\nStacks with other modules of the same type.","mDisplayName":"","mItemCategory":"Cat_FlightModules_C","mPersistentBigIcon":"Icon_GreenFlightComputer","mSmallIcon":"I