_ConfigPropertySection_C_0.BP_ConfigPropertySection_C_0.BP_ConfigPropertyArray_C_1.BP_ConfigPropertyString_C_1","DisplayName":"Mods to ignore","Tooltip":"Don't render overlays for these mods. Match mod display name exactly, not mod reference (ex. \\"Storage Teleporter\\", \\"Satisfactory\\", no quotes)\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault empty.","WidgetType":"ECP_ArrayWidgetType::CPA_Vertical","bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Enabled","Tooltip":"Enable the \\"what am I looking at\\" overlay feature.\\r\\nThe overlay will display the name of the target and what mod added it.\\r\\nIt can also display some extra information depending on what you're looking at.\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault checked","Value":true,"bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Re Check Same Target","Tooltip":"If enabled, the widget will be re-evaluated every time the Update Interval elapses even if you're looking at the same thing.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis allows better live readouts (ex. contents of a container) but can be disabled if you're experiencing lag.\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault checked","Value":true,"bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Enabled","Tooltip":"Looking at a building will display information\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault checked","Value":true,"bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Enabled","Tooltip":"Looking at a painted object will display its color information.\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault checked","Value":true,"bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Ignore Default Swatches","Tooltip":"Checked: Don't show paint info if the target is painted with one of the default swatches\\r\\nUnchecked: Display paint info regardless of the swatch\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault checked","Value":true,"bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Enabled","Tooltip":"Looking at a plant will display information\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault checked","Value":true,"bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Enabled","Tooltip":"Enable the item tooltip modification feature.\\r\\nYou can turn this off if it's breaking another mod's tooltips. Please report this on the modding Discord if so!\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault checked","Value":true,"bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Require Keybind to Show Recipe Info","Tooltip":"Checked: Recipe info will be collapsed until unless you are holding the keybind to show it.\\r\\nUnchecked: Recipe info will be shown by default; pressing the keybind will collapse it instead.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe keybind is your base-game Sprint key.\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault checked","Value":true,"bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"bHidden":true,"bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"bHidden":true,"bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Enabled","Tooltip":"Radioactive items will have their header turned green and be given a radiation symbol in the top right of the header.\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault checked","Value":true,"bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Enabled","Tooltip":"Item tooltips will display what mod added the item the tooltip pertains to.\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault checked","Value":true,"bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Hide on content from Satisfactory","Tooltip":"If the item being hovered over is from Satisfactory itself, the tooltip will be excluded\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault unchecked","bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Show Points for Exactly N Items","Tooltip":"Checked: When displaying sink points, if the item stack is not 1 and not the max stack size, the sink points for sinking exactly that many items is also displayed.\\r\\nUnchecked: This additional information is excluded\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault unchecked","bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Enabled","Tooltip":"The sink points awarded for shredding one, or a stack (when relevant), of an item will be displayed\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault checked","Value":true,"bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Show Message on Non-Sinkable Items","Tooltip":"Checked: Display \\"Can't be Sinked\\" on items that can't be sinked.\\r\\nUnchecked: Do not display anything on items that can't be sinked.\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault checked","Value":true,"bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Enabled","Tooltip":"The maximum stack size of an item will be displayed along with an icon indicating its form (solid, liquid, gas)\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault checked","Value":true,"bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Asset Path","Tooltip":"Display the asset path of the item, useful for modmakers and debugging\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault unchecked","bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Enabled","Tooltip":"The energy in MJ stored in one, or a stack (when relevant), of an item will be displayed\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault checked","Value":true,"bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Show Message on Non-Fuel Items","Tooltip":"Checked: Display \\"No Stored Energy\\" on items that have no energy value.\\r\\nUnchecked: Do not display anything on items that have no energy value.\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault unchecked","bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Show Energy for Exactly N Items","Tooltip":"Checked: When displaying energy, if the item stack is not 1 and not the max stack size, the energy stored in exactly that many items is also displayed.\\r\\nUnchecked: This additional information is excluded\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault unchecked","bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Asset Path","Tooltip":"Display the asset path of the recipe, useful for modmakers and debugging\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault unchecked","bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Rename Recipe Listings","Tooltip":"Checked: Recipes will display their custom names ex. \\"Alternate: Crystal Computer\\"\\r\\nUnchecked: Recipes will display \\"Standard Recipe\\", \\"Alternate Recipe 1\\" etc. (which is determined by the order they are unlocked in)\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault checked","Value":true,"bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Enabled","Tooltip":"Recipe tooltips will display what mod added the recipe.\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault checked","Value":true,"bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Hide on content from Satisfactory","Tooltip":"If the recipe is from Satisfactory itself, the information will be excluded\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault unchecked","bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Enabled","Tooltip":"Show the AWESOME Sink points profit provided by the recipe outputs compared to its ingredients\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault checked","Value":true,"bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Show Estimates","Tooltip":"Checked: Even if a Sink Points Improvement reading is an estimate (hover the warning symbol from the Codex to see why), still display it.\\r\\nUnchecked: Hide the section if the Sink Points Improvement value is not exact.\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault checked","Value":true,"bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"'Per Minute' Measurement","Tooltip":"Checked: Also display the value as \\"points per minute\\"\\r\\nUnchecked: Do not display this extra info\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault unchecked","bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Enabled","Tooltip":"Hovering over a Build Gun menu category will display the mod that added the category.\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault checked","Value":true,"bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Hide on categories from Satisfactory","Tooltip":"If the category is from Satisfactory itself, the tooltip will be excluded\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault unchecked","bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Enabled","Tooltip":"The Build Gun menu sidebar will display what mod added the building.\\r\\nIf a different mod added the recipe for the building, its name will also be displayed.\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault checked","Value":true,"bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Recipe Asset Path","Tooltip":"Display the asset path of the recipe, useful for modmakers and debugging\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault unchecked","bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Hide on content from Satisfactory","Tooltip":"If the building, and its recipe, are from Satisfactory itself, the information will be excluded.\\r\\nIf a recipe for a base-game content is added by a mod, only the recipe info will be displayed.\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault unchecked","bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Enabled","Tooltip":"When selecting the recipe for a machine, the info pane on the side will display what mod added the recipe.\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault checked","Value":true,"bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Hide on content from Satisfactory","Tooltip":"If the recipe is from Satisfactory itself, the information will be excluded\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault unchecked","bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"General: Logging","Tooltip":"Produce log messages for other uncategorized features","bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Enable Points Suggestion Chat Command","Tooltip":"Enables the chat command '/tfit_suggest_points' which will produce a text file on disk with Awesome Sink points suggestions for all loaded recipes. This is off by default because it running it is an expensive operation, and because enabling it will load an additional set of recipes and Resource Sink points values for some normally unsinkable items.\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault unchecked"},{"DisplayName":"Overlay: Logging","Tooltip":"When checking what the player is looking at, produce log messages about the process.\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault unchecked","bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Tooltips: Logging","Tooltip":"When modifying item tooltips, produce log messages about the process.\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault unchecked","bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Overlay: Debug Mode","Tooltip":"When checking what the player is looking at, always display the first actor information, even if the hit is not already handled by a specific handler. Tells you hit actor name, distance, component, hit location.\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault unchecked","bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Overlay: Debug Hit Marker","Tooltip":"Creates an indicator (beacon mesh) that shows exactly where in the world the line trace connected with the target.\\r\\n\\r\\nDefault unchecked","bRequiresWorldReload":false},{"DisplayName":"Red","WidgetType":"ECP_FloatWidgetType::CPF_Slider","bRequir