eHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_100.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"Congratulations for reaching the last milestone 100!!!\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nThanks for playing with the 100+ Milestones Mod. \\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 100\\r\\n\\r\\nMod made by Andre Aquila and M.Frost","mDisplayName":"100+ Milestones Mod BIG","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_11.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"The HUB, or \\"Habitat and Utility Base\\", is the heart of the factory and the first build-able structure in game. Initially only containing a Craft Bench and the HUB Terminal, it can be upgraded as the Engineer progresses along the Milestones in Tier 0. The completed HUB, in addition, contains 2 small Biomass Burners, a FICSIT Freighter and a living quarter.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Reward 11","mDisplayName":"The Hub","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_12.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"The Biomass Burner is an early Power generator that uses organic material as fuel. These materials can be gathered from trees, shrubs, and most flora and fauna found in the world. Later these raw materials can be refined into Biomass and Solid Biofuel for higher fuel efficiency.\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 12","mDisplayName":"The Biomass Burner","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_13.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"Smelts ore into ingots. Can be automated by feeding ore into it with a conveyor belt connected to the input. The produced ingots can be automatically extracted by connecting a conveyor belt to the output.\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 13","mDisplayName":"Smelter","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_14.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"Crafts one part into another part.\\r\\nCan be automated by feeding parts into it with a conveyor belt connected to the input. The produced parts can be automatically extracted by connecting a conveyor belt to the output.\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 14","mDisplayName":"Constructor","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_15.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"A Miner is a type of resource extractor that automatically extracts solid resources when built or placed on top of a resource node. There are 4 types of miners available: Portable Miner, Miner Mk.1, Miner Mk.2 and Miner Mk.3.\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 15","mDisplayName":"Miner","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_16.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"Satisfactory Modding\\r\\n\\r\\nRefined Power for your factory! \\r\\n\\r\\nMade by:\\r\\n\\r\\nMrhid6 - Author\\r\\nTrunkyredstone - C++ Dev\\r\\nIamlegend_tv - Mod Dev\\r\\nI'm_a_chicken29 - Mod Dev\\r\\nTom - 3D Artist\\r\\nVasillo 3D Artist\\r\\nDeantendo - User Interfaces\\r\\nSML Devs - C++ Help\\r\\nTBNRregs - Ideas \\u0026 Tester","mDisplayName":"Refined Power Mod","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_17.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"Crafts two parts into another part.\\r\\nCan be automated by feeding parts into it with a conveyor belt connected to the input. The produced parts can be automatically extracted by connecting a conveyor belt to the output.\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 17","mDisplayName":"Assembler","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_18.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"A Satisfactory Mod which adds a couple of Lamps to the game.\\r\\n\\r\\nMade by Panakotta00","mDisplayName":"Light it Up Mod","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_19.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"Burns Coal to boil Water, the produced steam rotates turbines to generate electricity for the power grid.\\r\\nHas a Conveyor Belt and Pipe input, so both the Coal and Water supply can be automated.\\r\\nResource consumption will automatically be lowered to meet power demands.\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 19","mDisplayName":"Coal Generator","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_2.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"Coffee Stain Studios AB is a Swedish video game developer based in Skövde. Founded in 2010 by nine University of Skövde students\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 2","mDisplayName":"Coffee Stain Studios","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_20.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"Teleport you from a teleporter to another one ! \\r\\n\\r\\nMade by Boyshall\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 20","mDisplayName":"Teleporter Mod","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_21.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"Smelts two Ore resources into Ingots. Can be automated by feeding ore into it with a conveyor belt connected to the inputs. The produced ingots can be automatically extracted by connecting a conveyor belt to the output.\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 21","mDisplayName":"Foundry","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_22.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"Refines fluid and/or solid parts into other parts.\\r\\nHead Lift: 10 meters.\\r\\n(Allows fluids to be transported 10 meters upwards.)\\r\\nContains both a Conveyor Belt and Pipe input and output, to allow for the automation of various recipes.\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 22","mDisplayName":"Refinery","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_23.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"The Fuel Generator is a Building which generates 150 MW of Power using  Fuel,  Turbofuel or  Liquid Biofuel.\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 23","mDisplayName":"Fuel Generator","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_24.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"Crafts three or four parts into another part.\\r\\nCan be automated by feeding parts into it with a conveyor belt connected to the input. The produced parts can be automatically extracted by connecting a conveyor belt to the output.\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 24","mDisplayName":"Manufacturer","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_25.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"Default extraction rate:\\r\\n120 m3 (120k liters) per minute.\\r\\nHead Lift: 10 meters.\\r\\n(Allows fluids to be transported 10 meters upwards.)\\r\\nExtracts water from the body of water it is built on. Note that the water needs to be deep enough and rivers do not commonly suffice.\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 25","mDisplayName":"Water Extractor","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_26.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"Normal extraction rate: 120m3 oil per minute.\\r\\nHead Lift: 10 meters. (Allows fluids to be transported 10 meters upwards.)\\r\\nCan be built on an Oil Node to extract Crude Oil. Extraction rates depend on node purity.\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 26","mDisplayName":"Oil Extractor","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_27.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"Satisfactory Biome Map\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 27","mDisplayName":"Biome Map","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_28.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"The Geo Thermal Generator is a building that generates 200 MW of Power. It can only be built on a Geyser node. It is unlocked in the M.A.M. under Caterium Research.\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 28","mDisplayName":"Geo Thermal Generator","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_29.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"It generates 2500 MW at 100% Clock speed. At 100% power utilization, a Nuclear Power Plant consumes 0.2 Nuclear Fuel Rods and 300 m3 of Water per minute, which disallows the power plant to sustain overclocked production due to the throughput limit of Pipelines, and produces 5 barrels of Waste per minute. Each Nuclear Fuel Rod lasts for 300 seconds, which is equivalent to 750 000 MJ (750 GJ).\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 29","mDisplayName":"Nuclear Power Plant","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_3.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"A 1st person open-world factory building sim by Coffee Stain Studios. Conquer nature, build multi-story factories, and automate to satisfaction!\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 3","mDisplayName":"Satisfactory","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_30.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"The AWESOME Sink is a special building that produces  FICSIT Coupons for use in the AWESOME Shop by destroying items inserted into it, converting them into points based on their value or complexity, which in turn are used to print the aforementioned Coupons. Each successive Coupon requires more points to be printed.\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 30","mDisplayName":"Awesome Sink","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_31.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"The AWESOME Shop is a special building where  FICSIT Coupons generated from the AWESOME Sink can be spent to unlock blueprints or purchase parts for your factory. AWESOME is an acronym, which stands for \\"Anti-Waste Effort for Stress-Testing of Materials on Exoplanets\\".\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 31","mDisplayName":"Awesome Shop","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_32.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootCo