g\\r\\n\\r\\nore Milestones Mod - Rewards 57","mDisplayName":"Satisfactory","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_58.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"Best Wallpaper\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 58","mDisplayName":"Satisfactory","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_59.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"Made by Zoros\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 59","mDisplayName":"Satisfactory","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_6.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"Community Manager and programmer\\r\\nhttps://twitter.com/jembawls\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 6","mDisplayName":"Jace Varlet","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_60.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"\\"Highly classified until only recently, two U.S. Army Special Forces detachments were stationed far behind the Iron Curtain in West Berlin during the Cold War. The units' existence and missions were protected by cover stories, their operations were secret. \\r\\nThe massive armies of the Soviet Union and its Warsaw Pact allies posed a huge threat to the nations of Western Europe. US military planners decided they needed a plan to slow the juggernaut they expected when and if a war began. The plan was Special Forces Berlin.\\"","mDisplayName":"Special Forces Berlin","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_61.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"\\"10TH ANNIVERSARY EDITION“Thanks to Legacy of Honor, readers now have the chance to see just how Eagle Scouts have served, loved, and led America.” ―Scouting magazineOver the past century, America’s Eagle Scouts have earned a reputation for service, virtue, and leadership that is recognized throughout the world. But few people realize the full extent to which Eagle Scouts have made a mark on American history. They have served as astronauts, soldiers, politicians, and businessmen, but they have also been the fathers, brothers, Scoutmasters, coaches, and other role models who have played an integral part in American life.\\r\\n\\"","mDisplayName":"Legacy of Honor","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_62.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"\\"From the award-winning historian and filmmakers of The Civil War, Baseball, The War, The Roosevelts, and others: a vivid, uniquely powerful history of the conflict that tore America apart--the companion volume to the major, multipart PBS film to be aired in September 2017.\\r\\n\\"","mDisplayName":"The Vietnam War","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_63.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"\\"The ancient Chinese military classic that is widely admired today by both military and business strategists--in a new translation, with new notes and commentary.\\r\\nFor more than two thousand years, The Art of War has provided leaders with essential tactical and management advice. An elemental part of Chinese culture, it has also become a touchstone in the West for achieving success, whether on the battlefield or in business. This Everyman's Library edition features a brilliant new translation by Peter Harris.\\"","mDisplayName":"The Art of War","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_64.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"\\"Want to know what Vietnam was really like?Real stories told by real people, in their own words, 100 veterans, men and women, caught up in an all too real war. From the Delta to the DMZ, come walk in their boots. If you were there, you understand. If you weren't, grab a copy and you will, because they’re like Doritos. Try a few and you won't be able to stop.The Vietnam War dominated my generation and affected so many lives in so many different ways. Some of us were drafted. Some enlisted. Some became war heroes, intentional or not, but most of us were just trying to survive. As we all knew, Vietnam was all about luck, good or bad.\\r\\n\\"","mDisplayName":"Our Vietnam Wars","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_65.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"\\"The true story of one man's reluctant but relentless war against the invaders of his country.A quiet, wealthy plantation owner, Jack Hinson watched the start of the Civil War with disinterest. Opposed to secession and a friend to Union and Confederate commanders alike, he did not want a war. After Union soldiers seized and murdered his sons, placing their decapitated heads on the gateposts of his estate, Hinson could remain indifferent no longer. He commissioned a special rifle for long-range accuracy, he took to the woods, and he set out for revenge.\\r\\n\\"","mDisplayName":"Jack Hinson's One-Man War, A Civil War Sniper","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_66.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"The Walker is a one-eyed cyclops-like monster, which can be found in a cave in Abyss Cliffs. There is only one creature on the map, and it does not respawn upon reloading the game.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe enemy is from Sanctum 2, another game by Coffee Stain Studios.","mDisplayName":"Walker","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_67.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"Mystery!","mDisplayName":"Crab Boss","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_68.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"Alpha Spitters are the larger and more powerful variant of the Spitter. They come in 2 colors: Red and Green.","mDisplayName":" Alpha Spitter","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_69.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"The Fluffy-tailed Hog (a.k.a 'Hog'), is a melee hostile creature that deals damage with its tackle attack. It is the most common creature in the world.","mDisplayName":"Fluffy-tailed Hog","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_7.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"Community Manager and programmer\\r\\nhttps://twitter.com/BustaSnutt/\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 7","mDisplayName":"Snutt","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_70.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDisplayName":"Grow your Nuts","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_71.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"The family need your loyalty.\\r\\n\\r\\nCome to our Discord and post a screenshot of your Factory holding the +100 Coffe Cup to be part of the CoffeCup Mafia.\\r\\n\\r\\n https://discord.gg/WQBz8HG\\r\\n\\r\\n","mDisplayName":"CoffeCup Mafia","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_72.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"by bobert","mDisplayName":"Pioneer","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_73.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStream