 will result in a sound file being played. Aside from these sounds, it currently seems to function only as a collectible.\\r\\n\\r\\nREward 76","mDisplayName":"Somersloop","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_77.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"by u/professorhazard\\r\\n\\r\\nMilestone 77","mDisplayName":"Scared Doggo ","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_78.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"Reward 78","mDisplayName":"Bird","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_79.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"Reward 79","mDisplayName":"Satisfactory","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologram","mSkipBuildEffect":true}]},"Prizes/Build/Book_8.uexp":{"FGBuildable":[{"RootComponent":"RootComponent","bGenerateOverlapEventsDuringLevelStreaming":true,"bRelevantForLevelBounds":false,"mAllowCleranceSeparationEvenIfStackedOn":true,"mDescription":"Welcome to FICSIT Incorporated! A company specializing in the research, development, and application of new technology and science, we do anything to find short-term solutions to long-term problems! As part of our brand-new Save The Day program, you'll be sent to one of many alien planets in an effort to contribute to Project Assembly, a project I am legally bound to say nothing about for fear of our lives. And my job.\\r\\n\\r\\nMore Milestones Mod - Rewards 8","mDisplayName":"Ficsit","mHologramClass":"FGBuildableHologr